{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your <strong>sanity</strong>, your <strong>phone skills</strong>, and your <strong>friendships</strong>. You can either:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo:</strong> like some insane person who loves to suffer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Online CO-OP:</strong> and split the suffering among your friends group (more healthy)<strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Flippy - the Brickphone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this happened because little Jeff <strong>slipped on a strategically placed banana peel</strong> and <strong>yeeted the phone</strong> into a storm drain... Now <strong>Jeff and Flippy are separated</strong> and feeling sad...  But <strong>You have the power</strong> <strong>to fix this!</strong> Use your phone-flipping skills to reunite them and give them a happy ending!        </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate-Only Movement</strong> \u2013 Flippy doesn't have legs... Your only movements are rotation and a vibration jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Climb\u00a0</strong>\u2013\u00a0Small mistake, big drop. 10 different childhood areas and a clear goal - reach the top and reunite with little Jeff.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-Op Chaos</strong> \u2013 1\u20134 players. Pull friends up. Drop them \u201cby accident.\u201d Friendship DLC not included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Challenges</strong> \u2013 Meet quirky characters, uncover weird lore, and most importantly, TRY to complete their platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Ready </strong>\u2013 Quick restarts are implemented so you can efficiently torture yourself with speedruns. Master the way of Flippy and make your way back to Jeff as soon as possible!<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoint Assist (Optional)</strong> \u2013 A softer mode for when your soul needs a hug. Insane people will flame you. Use it anyway.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fashionista Flippy </strong>\u2013 Customize Flippy with different phone cases, charms, and stickers! Even a phone always wants to look its best.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you Have Games on your Phone? </strong>\u2013 The answer is yes! Find, unlock, and play classic mobile games from the past. Truly a game-ception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incoming Calls </strong>\u2013 Answer random calls for Jeff and listen to all the tea. Some are heartwarming from Mom, but others can be a little more on the sketchy side.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This difficult game tests your patience. Falling is part of the challenge.\u00a0Will you rise or quit when it gets tough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826670?t=1767856682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826670?t=1767856682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/6c65b1ec86b50b650c09f9d25a7b8bad34110b35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767856682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/6c65b1ec86b50b650c09f9d25a7b8bad34110b35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767856682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4111020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Flippin' Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/fe34b3e30de4242c7eaf9726484d724a.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your <strong>sanity</strong>, your <strong>phone skills</strong>, and your <strong>friendships</strong>. You can either:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo:</strong> like some insane person who loves to suffer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Online CO-OP:</strong> and split the suffering among your friends group (more healthy)<strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Flippy - the Brickphone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this happened because little Jeff <strong>slipped on a strategically placed banana peel</strong> and <strong>yeeted the phone</strong> into a storm drain... Now <strong>Jeff and Flippy are separated</strong> and feeling sad...  But <strong>You have the power</strong> <strong>to fix this!</strong> Use your phone-flipping skills to reunite them and give them a happy ending!        </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate-Only Movement</strong> \u2013 Flippy doesn't have legs... Your only movements are rotation and a vibration jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Climb\u00a0</strong>\u2013\u00a0Small mistake, big drop. 10 different childhood areas and a clear goal - reach the top and reunite with little Jeff.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-Op Chaos</strong> \u2013 1\u20134 players. Pull friends up. Drop them \u201cby accident.\u201d Friendship DLC not included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Challenges</strong> \u2013 Meet quirky characters, uncover weird lore, and most importantly, TRY to complete their platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Ready </strong>\u2013 Quick restarts are implemented so you can efficiently torture yourself with speedruns. Master the way of Flippy and make your way back to Jeff as soon as possible!<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoint Assist (Optional)</strong> \u2013 A softer mode for when your soul needs a hug. Insane people will flame you. Use it anyway.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fashionista Flippy </strong>\u2013 Customize Flippy with different phone cases, charms, and stickers! Even a phone always wants to look its best.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you Have Games on your Phone? </strong>\u2013 The answer is yes! Find, unlock, and play classic mobile games from the past. Truly a game-ception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incoming Calls </strong>\u2013 Answer random calls for Jeff and listen to all the tea. Some are heartwarming from Mom, but others can be a little more on the sketchy side.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This difficult game tests your patience. Falling is part of the challenge.\u00a0Will you rise or quit when it gets tough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.poster.avif?t=1767856682\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.webm?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.mp4?t=1767856682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Elegant Horse Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/dd2dc2b2ad297ba7536fe3984fe680ff0e39ece3/header.jpg?t=1767856682","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Elegant Horse Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Flipping is Hard","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64 bit) or Newer (64 bit) Windows OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 770 2GB / AMD Radeon R9 280<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64 bit) or Newer (64 bit) Windows OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4770K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8